<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian 42-day T-bill sold at average 11.7447 pct.</title>
<headline>Nigerian 42-day T-bill sold at average 11.7447 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigeria's Central Bank said on Friday it sold 3,150 million naira worth of 42-day treasury bills carrying a weighted average rate of 11.7447 percent.</p>
<p>Bids totalled 3,650 million naira and the true yield will be 11.8589 percent.</p>
<p>Last week's sales were 1,777 million naira worth of 42-day treasury bills at a weighted average rate of 11.7000 percent.</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
